<title>USA: Pacificare eliminates two executive jobs.</title>
<headline>Pacificare eliminates two executive jobs.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>PacifiCare Health Systems Inc said Wednesday it will eliminate the positions of regional vice president and general manager for the Northwest region as part of its acquisition of FHP International Corp.</p>
<p>Mary O. McWilliams, PacifiCare's Northwest regional vice president and Maureen McLaughlin, general manager of PacifiCare of Washington, will resign effective November 1.</p>
<p>Brad Bowlus, chief executive of California Dental Health Plan (CDHP)/PacifiCare Dental, a PacifiCare unit, has been named president and chief executive of Washington, effective October 21.</p>
